sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Trig as Report cron / Rebuild button
    participant Rep as Inbox report agent
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant Gmail as Gmail (IMAP)
    participant Cal as Google Calendar
    participant Mem as Memory store
    participant LLM as Model (REPORT_LLM)
    participant F as inbox_report.json

    Trig->>Rep: generate(force)
    Rep->>DB: stored mail of the last 30 days (gather)
    Rep->>Gmail: unread count, Sent folder threads
    Rep->>Cal: events for 14 days with your response
    Rep->>Rep: snapshot: counts, needs review, stale, today, invites, money, candidate bodies, previous ids
    alt fingerprint unchanged and not forced
        Rep->>F: keep the cached overview
    else changed or forced
        Rep->>Mem: base rules, learned rules
        Rep->>LLM: skill + memory (system), snapshot (user), structured Overview, retried once
        LLM-->>Rep: calendar notes, waiting on you / them, deadlines, money, first thing
        Rep->>Rep: render markdown, link items to #inbox/id, mark new ones
        Rep->>F: generated_at, counts, fingerprint, item_ids, briefing
    end
    Trig-->>Trig: Home tab reads GET /api/report
